# Catisen torrc example
# This is a starter template for local tor.exe usage with Catisen.
# Copy and adjust paths for your environment.

SocksPort 9050
ControlPort 9051
CookieAuthentication 1

# Optional hardening
SafeLogging 1
AvoidDiskWrites 1

# Optional bridges (replace placeholders with valid bridge lines)
UseBridges 1
ClientTransportPlugin obfs4 exec C:\\path\\to\\obfs4proxy.exe
Bridge obfs4 <bridge-line-1>
Bridge obfs4 <bridge-line-2>
Bridge obfs4 <bridge-line-3>

# Optional exit constraints (example)
# ExitNodes {de},{nl},{ch}
# StrictNodes 0
